                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 3]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Text of Paragraph 4 of Article 16a of the Draft Peace
                        Treaty With Italy as Approved by the Legal and Drafting
                    Commission</hi></head>
                <p>Upon the renunciation of Italian sovereignty, the Free Territory of Trieste shall
                    be governed in accordance with a provisional regime to be established by the
                    Security Council, which shall remain in force until such date as the Security
                    Council shall fix for the coming into force of a permanent Statute which shall
                    have been approved by it. The Free Territory shall thenceforth be governed by
                    the provisions of such permanent statute.</p>
            </div>
